## Deployment Instructions

### Dev Environment

```bash
# Initialize Terraform
terraform init

# Plan with dev values
terraform plan -var-file="environments/dev.tfvars" -out=tfplan-dev

# Apply (set password via env var)
export TF_VAR_rds_master_password="$(aws secretsmanager get-random-password --query 'RandomPassword' --output text)"
terraform apply tfplan-dev

# Retrieve dev credentials (if needed)
terraform output -json dev_access_key_id
terraform output -json dev_secret_access_key  # Store securely, never commit
```

### Prod Environment

```bash
# Plan with prod values
terraform plan -var-file="environments/prod.tfvars" -out=tfplan-prod

# Apply (password from Secrets Manager)
export TF_VAR_rds_master_password="$(aws secretsmanager get-secret-value --secret-id prod/db/password --query 'SecretString' --output text)"
terraform apply tfplan-prod

# Verify prod protections
terraform output rds_endpoint
```

